{
  "description": [
    "Cross-language golden vectors for the GZAC->host HMAC scheme (plan §3.9 / §5).",
    "Canonical string: `{METHOD.toUpperCase()}\\n{path}\\n{timestamp}\\n{bodyHash}` where",
    "bodyHash = lowercase-hex SHA-256(body) and the HMAC-SHA256 key is the host ADMIN_TOKEN (secret).",
    "This construction is defined by the Kotlin signer",
    "backend/external-plugin/.../security/ExternalPluginHmacSigner.kt and reproduced by the host's",
    "plugin-host/app/src/security/hmac.ts (computeSignature/computeBodyHash).",
    "expectedSignature and bodyHash below were generated by an INDEPENDENT oracle (openssl 3.x),",
    "not by the Node implementation under test, so a regression on either side fails a test rather",
    "than two implementations drifting together. `body` is the exact UTF-8 string that was hashed",
    "(no trailing newline); an empty string is the SHA-256 of \"\"."
  ],
  "secret": "host-admin-secret",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "json-push-body",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/host/configurations/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-10T12:00:00Z",
      "body": "{\"serviceToken\":\"eyJ-fresh-service-token\",\"gzacBaseUrl\":\"http://gzac:8080\"}",
      "bodyHash": "6cee991b8be50fd3f703a9ca48e704a11fee848a44c7886173859d9010b729e2",
      "expectedSignature": "03140b1917b44d49a4ea8a0757a93da14cc9c004a6ccb8ca7b10df9d3248c196"
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-body-get",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/host/plugins",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-10T12:00:00Z",
      "body": "",
      "bodyHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "expectedSignature": "8894b8f4675a21c15c0801cf6b81e8eb488933f49c66ce75d4c5eaec7ddf070e"
    },
    {
      "name": "empty-body-delete",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/host/configurations/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-10T12:00:00Z",
      "body": "",
      "bodyHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
